WEBVTT

00:04:57.501 --> 00:05:02.006
and about the deep wisdom
of my ancestors,

00:05:02.048 --> 00:05:04.008
didn't connect with my head.

00:05:05.217 --> 00:05:07.178
I was doing what most of us do.

00:05:07.219 --> 00:05:10.765
We get educated in the modern
world, modern education,

00:05:10.765 --> 00:05:14.018
and we think that, for example,

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:19.607
climate change can only be solved
by science and technology,

00:05:19.648 --> 00:05:22.234
or at least science and technology alone.

00:05:22.276 --> 00:05:23.444
Think about it.

00:05:23.444 --> 00:05:26.739
The world thrived for centuries

00:05:26.781 --> 00:05:30.159
until logging, mining and other extractive